╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  1. ORBWALKER PLUGIN — Thiếu so với NewOrbwalker.cs                        ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

[  ] 1.1  Champion-specific logic
         - Sett: passive attack (nextAttackIsPassive, AttackCastDelay / 8)
         - Kalista: isKalista CanMove always true, MissileLaunched reset
         - Graves: ammo system check (gravesbasicattackammo1), delay formula
         - Jhin: JhinPassiveReload check
         - Rengar: RengarQ/RengarQEmp attack reset, animation handling
         - Aphelios: weapon-specific missile speed, reload check, crescendum reset

[  ] 1.2  GetProjectileSpeed() per champion
         - Jinx (JinxQ buff → 2000), Kayle (range check → 2250),
         - Neeko (neekowpassiveready → max), Viktor (ViktorPowerTransferReturn → max)
         - Jayce (form check), Ivern (ivernwpassive → 1600)
         - Poppy (poppypassivebuff → 1600), Aphelios (weapon tooltipvars)
         - GetBasicAttackMissileSpeed(): IsMelee → MaxFloat, else BasicAttack.MissileSpeed

[  ] 1.3  CanAttackWithWindWall — Yasuo WindWall collision check
         - WindWallBrokenChampions[] array (64 champs)
         - SpecialWindWallChampions[] array (Kayle, Elise, Nidalee, Jayce, Gnar, Azir, Neeko)
         - Gọi Collisions.HasYasuoWindWallCollision(from, to)

[  ] 1.4  Jax CounterStrike check — skip attack if Jax has "JaxCounterStrike" buff

[  ] 1.5  Turret farm logic
         - CanTurretFarm(): check turret farm menu, support mode, player level, baron buff
         - Turret-priority last hitting: track turret aggro, calculate multi-shot HP prediction
         - FarmMenu: "TurretFarm" (Enabled/Off), "TurretFramMaxLevel" slider

[  ] 1.6  ShouldWait() — proper HP prediction cho lane control
         - Dùng HealthPrediction.GetPrediction() với GameObjects.Player.AttackDelay * 2000ms
         - So sánh predicted HP < GetAutoAttackDamage → return true (đợi last hit)
         - Có FastLaneClear mode delay riêng

[  ] 1.7  Pause timer system
         - int AttackPauseTick, MovePauseTick, AllPauseTick
         - SetAttackPauseTime(ms), SetMovePauseTime(ms), SetPauseTime(ms)
         - SetAttackServerPauseTime(), SetMoveServerPauseTime(), SetServerPauseTime()
         - Check trong CanAttack() và CanMove()

[  ] 1.8  MissileLaunched check cho CanMove
         - Track MissileLaunched = false khi OnDoCast
         - MissileLaunched = true khi OnProcessSpellCast (auto attack)
         - CanMove: if MissileLaunched && MissileCheck enabled → return true

[  ] 1.9  Menu options thiếu
         - "ComboWithMove" keybind (combo nhưng không di chuyển)
         - "FastLaneClear" keybind (fast farm mode)
         - "Fast Farm Delay" slider (0-1000ms)
         - "TurretFarm" dropdown (Enabled/Off) + "TurretFramMaxLevel" slider
         - "CalcItemDamage" bool (tính sát thương item)
         - "YasuoWallCheck" bool
         - "MissileCheck" bool (Use Missile Checks)
         - "SupportMode_<champion>" bool
         - "HighOrb" bool (tần suất walk cao hơn)
         - "CalculateRunaway" bool (tính khoảng cách chạy trốn)
         - "DrawChaseRange" bool
         - "ShowFakeClick" bool

[  ] 1.10 ForceChase mode
         - MiscMenu: "FindKey" keybind + "Range" slider (0-500)
         - Khi Combo + FindKey active → mở rộng attack range thêm Range value
         - Vẽ circle rainbow (colorindex) quanh player

[  ] 1.11 LaneClear target priority
         - Sort: Siege > Super > attacks-to-kill (ceil(hp/ad)) > MaxHealth descending
         - Track LaneClearMinion (sticky target nếu vẫn valid)
         - Kiểm tra prediction 2x attack delay xem minion có sống đủ lâu không

[  ] 1.12 Move path angle check
         - Kiểm tra angle giữa current waypoint và new waypoint
         - Skip move nếu angle < 10° và distance < 500
         - Throttle: 70ms + min(60, Ping), nếu angle >= 60° thì 60ms

[  ] 1.13 Randomize movement khi mouse quá gần
         - OrbwalkerMenu["MoveRandom"] → extend position 0.6-1.0 * 400 units

[  ] 1.14 GetSpecialMinion
         - Barrels (GP): gangplankbarrel (owner level check, barrel timer)
         - Wards: EnemyWards in range
         - JunglePlant: in range
         - Pets: IsPet(true) check

[  ] 1.15 LimitAttack — Don't Kite nếu AttackSpeed > 2.5
         - Nếu AttackDelay < 0.3846 && autoAttackCounter % 3 != 0 → skip move

╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  2. TARGET SELECTOR PLUGIN — Thiếu so với NewTargetSelector.cs             ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

[  ] 2.1  IsValidTarget thiếu check
         - IsInvulnerableVisual check (property trên GameObject)
         - IsZombie() check (Sion passive, Karthus passive, Kog'Maw passive)
         - HasBuff("UndyingRage") && HP <= 71 → skip (Tryndamere ult)
         - IsTargetable check (đã có nhưng cần verify)

[  ] 2.2  GetRealHealth — HP thực tế theo damage type
         - Physical: HP + PhysicalShield + AllShield
         - Magical: HP + MagicalShield + AllShield
         - True: HP + AllShield
         - C# dùng x.GetRealHeath(damageType)

[  ] 2.3  Smart AD/AP mode — port AaIndicator logic
         - C# dùng Base.AaIndicator(x, damageType) — scoring function tính threat
         - Cần port hoặc tạo equivalent: (EHP / priority) scoring

[  ] 2.4  OnlySelectTarget enforcement trong GetTargets()
         - Khi "Only Attack Select Target" enabled + SelectedTarget valid
         → chỉ return list gồm 1 target duy nhất

[  ] 2.5  InCurrentAutoAttackRange với Azir soldiers
         - Check AzirSoldiers distance ≤ 770 từ player
         - Nếu soldier cách target ≤ 350 → true

╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  3. GAMEOBJECT — Properties thiếu                                          ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

[  ] 3.1  Thêm properties cơ bản
         - IsMoving (đọc từ AiManager)
         - IsMelee (AttackRange < 300)
         - IsMe (address == GameObjects::Player.address)
         - ServerPosition (AiManager.GetServerPosition)

[  ] 3.2  Path / Waypoints
         - GetWaypoints() → vector<Vec2>
         - GetPath(Vec3 target) → vector<Vec3>
         - Path.Length (number of waypoints)

[  ] 3.3  Buff access trực tiếp trên GameObject
         - HasBuff(name) → tạo BuffManager(address).HasBuff(name)
         - HasBuffOfType(type) → BuffManager(address).HasBuffOfType(type)
         - GetBuff(name) → trả về Buff instance

[  ] 3.4  GetAutoAttackDamage(target, includePassive, calcItemDmg)
         - Base AD damage + crit + bonus on-hit
         - Item passive damage (Sheen, Trinity, BOTRK, Kraken, etc.)
         - Champion passive damage (Vayne W, Ashe passive, etc.)
         - Giản lược: ít nhất CalcPhysicalDamage(TotalAD) + item modifier

[  ] 3.5  InCurrentAutoAttackRange(extraRange, fromObj)
         - GetRealAutoAttackRange() = AttackRange + BoundingRadius
         - Distance ≤ GetRealAutoAttackRange + target.BoundingRadius + extraRange
         - Azir special: soldier range check

[  ] 3.6  Type checks + properties
         - IsZombie() — check buffs: SionPassiveZone, KarthusDeathDefiedBuff, KogMawIcathianSurprise
         - IsInvulnerable — check IsInvulnerableVisual or invuln buffs
         - GameObjectType enum (AIHeroClient, AIMinionClient, AITurretClient, MissileClient)
         - Type property → read from offset
         - Owner property (pets → chủ sở hữu)
         - NetworkId (alias cho GetNetId)

[  ] 3.7  BasicAttack.MissileSpeed
         - Read SpellData → MissileSpeed từ SpellBook slot[0]
         - Dùng cho GetBasicAttackMissileSpeed()

[  ] 3.8  AttackCastDelay / AttackDelay properties
         - Expose GetAttackDelay() và GetAttackWindup() as inline properties

