║  6. SDK CORE — Thiếu                                                       ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

[  ] 6.1  Event System — hook game events
         - OnDoCast(sender, args) → detect auto attacks, spell casts
         - OnProcessSpellCast(sender, args) → spell cast start
         - OnPlayAnimation(sender, args) → animation events
         - OnStopCast(spellbook, args) → missile destroy events
         - OnDelete(sender) → object removed
         - Cần hook từ game hoặc track thay đổi mỗi frame

[  ] 6.2  Spellbook.OnStopCast + GameObject.OnDelete events

[  ] 6.3  Variables.GameTimeTickCount equivalent
         - int GetGameTickCount() = (int)(Game::GetTime() * 1000.0f)
         - Dùng trong timing calculations

[  ] 6.4  Expose IssueOrder trên GameObject
         - player.IssueOrder(OrderType::AttackUnit, target) giống E# API
         - Bên trong gọi Orbwalker::IssueOrder

[  ] 6.5  Collisions.HasYasuoWindWallCollision(from, to)
         - Scan cho WindWall objects (YasuoWMovingWall)
         - Check line intersection

[  ] 6.6  Game::IsShopOpen() check
         - Đọc shop state từ HUD

[  ] 6.7  Config save/load
         - Lưu menu settings ra JSON hoặc INI file
         - Load khi plugin khởi tạo
         - Auto-save khi thay đổi

[  ] 6.8  SpellData improvements
         - SpellData.Name (tên chiêu thức)
         - SpellData.TooltipVars (biến tooltip cho damage scaling)
         - SpellData.MissileSpeed

╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║  7. DAMAGE CALCULATION — Cần port                                          ║
╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

[  ] 7.1  GetAutoAttackDamage(target, includePassive, calcItemDmg)
         - Proper armor pen calculation (flat + percent + lethality scaling by level)
         - Crit damage calculation
         - Item on-hit: Sheen/Trinity/Lich Bane proc, BOTRK, Nashor's, Kraken Slayer
         - Champion passive: Vayne W, Ashe Q, etc.

[  ] 7.2  CalcPhysicalDamage cải thiện
         - Armor pen calculation: (target armor) * (1 - percent pen) - lethality
         - Lethality scales with attacker level

[  ] 7.3  CalcMagicalDamage cải thiện
         - Magic pen: flat pen after percent pen

