==============================================================================
  GHI CHÚ
==============================================================================
- Khi port từ C# → C++: EnsoulSharp SDK types map:
    AIHeroClient    → SDK::GameObject (filtered hero)
    AIMinionClient  → SDK::GameObject (filtered minion)
    AIBaseClient    → SDK::GameObject (base class)
    AttackableUnit  → SDK::GameObject
    Spellbook       → SDK::SpellBook
    BuffInstance     → SDK::Buff
    GameObjects     → SDK::GameObjects namespace
    Game            → SDK::Game namespace
    Variables       → SDK::Game::GetTickCount()
    MenuUI.Menu     → SDK::MenuUI::Menu
    MenuBool        → SDK::MenuUI::MenuBool
    MenuSlider      → SDK::MenuUI::MenuSlider
    MenuKeyBind     → SDK::MenuUI::MenuKeyBind
    Drawing         → SDK::Drawing namespace
    CircleRender    → SDK::Drawing::DrawCircle

- Spoof_call PHẢI được dùng cho mọi game function call (anti-cheat)
- __try/__except CHỈ dùng trong hàm KHÔNG có C++ objects (no std::string/vector)
  → Dùng Globals::ReadGameString/ReadPtrArray helpers thay thế
